  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3ea90144ef4ac7a4699131a7438e0496, type: 3}
  m_Name: B10 reward
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueStateSO
  <Texts>k__BackingField:
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Cxuixa sits down on all six, towering over me by a good
      five to six feet. Her ample bosoms are in full display, not even pretending
      her thin veil hides anything.
    TextAlignment: 257
  - <Text>k__BackingField: <color=#FF99DD>Of course. After my trials, it would be
      inappropriate of me not to reward my new follower for all his efforts. Triumphing
      over my enigmas must not have been easy, especially since I know most of your
      contemporaries no longer take a liking in bodies as... Exotic, as mine.
    TextAlignment: 260
  - <Text>k__BackingField: She sighs, but does not let that little aside sour her
      mood, returning immediately her unblinking gaze towards me.
    TextAlignment: 257
  - <Text>k__BackingField: <color=#FF99DD>Now, if you wish so, we could just skip
      ahead to the reward. Unless... You have any other questions?
    TextAlignment: 260
  <Illustration>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
  <Bgm>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
  <SFX>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
  <Item>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
  <Branches>k__BackingField:
  - Text: '- "What happened to your cult?"'
    Next: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2556c021282d1cf45a00cf7ba38188fc, type: 2}
  - Text: '- "What is this place?"'
    Next: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ed77ef69b09794d458a8f23e5a7d6021, type: 2}
  - Text: '- "How did I end up here?"'
    Next: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ff757848546bde744ac65aaf1691eeec, type: 2}
  - Text: '- "I have no more questions."'
    Next: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 310c89589aaf2b247af5a8ee27aff595, type: 2}
